(polyline (pts (xy 20.32 114.3) (xy 398.78 114.3)) (stroke (width 0.6) (type dash)) (uuid d71ddb97-5dd9-4e87-af98-baa6caf89beb))
(text "24 V POWER: high current, SELV" (at 345.44 111.3 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7d0f0060-9d75-471e-8130-caac56b906e3))
(text "LOGIC: 3.3 V / 5 V, same ground" (at 345.44 120.3 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cb6f6ad5-030d-4f6b-9c0d-cb173474acd9))
(text "No mains anywhere: the certified adapter does all the isolation. Keep motor current out of the logic ground: one star point at A2's GND." (at 20.32 112.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid eb71faf6-4597-4eb4-a704-40bd451903f6))
(text "24 V IN: FUSE, TVS, BULK" (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 89fa5c66-d6a1-445e-885f-978434530395))
(text "5 V BUCK" (at 114.3 44.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1f035160-072e-443d-9d7d-391ab2103791))
(text "BRAKE CHOPPER (optional)" (at 139.7 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9a4e0d9f-e422-4fd2-afe9-5fdd60656f6c))
(text "BUS SENSE" (at 182.88 76.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1e42f726-b61d-439c-bfcd-2b9b9dc247f0))
(text "H-BRIDGE (Pololu G2 24v13 module)" (at 220.98 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1f930a19-cebb-45b5-84d1-43ec0250aa5b))
(text "MOTOR TERMINAL SENSE (back-EMF)" (at 297.18 77.47 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid db7a9283-a178-48f1-8758-d982bc65fce7))
(text "RP2350B CORE BOARD (pins by GPIO number)" (at 124.46 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f34ed578-ad56-4895-943f-fe412a2c20ce))
(text "HAND-WHEEL INDEX SENSOR (one magnet, one pulse per stitch)" (at 200.66 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 315ac0b1-8a2f-4295-b4bf-8a39b09ec271))
(text "HAND-WHEEL ENCODER (two Hall latches, quadrature; same cable as the index)" (at 297.18 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 94cf01f0-61f2-43c5-b9b0-b391aac6fa07))
(text "HEEL SWITCH" (at 55.88 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 692cb724-83a5-44f6-9d5c-e8c4ee54e44e))
(text "SWITCHES (internal pull-ups)" (at 170.18 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2599b882-4bb0-477e-8c42-556418582f59))
(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f8d6f227-fe9a-4c19-89be-efba95787024))
(text "RESEARCH ONLY: NOT SAFE TO BUILD AS DRAWN. Not built, tested, measured or safety-assessed; a barrier drawn here is not proof of isolation." (at 20.32 258.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fe83ea04-e004-48f1-9261-6a909b990cbc))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 261.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7a58e4e7-b5b1-474d-a55d-6817edd2a6d1))
(text "1. The mains version's control side unchanged; the triac, zero-cross, relay and isolated supply replaced by a 24 V adapter, a buck and an H-bridge." (at 20.32 263.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2c6a76e0-8391-4035-82e0-5232331c5af8))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): PWM GP4 (20 kHz, PWM slice 2); DIR GP5; SLP GP6; FLT GP13 (internal pull-up); BRAKE GP1; HALL GP7; ENC_A/B GP2/GP3;" (at 20.32 265.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 27571b32-08d2-438e-8ce2-cb3546f2148b))
(text "   STITCH GP10; HEEL GP11; NEEDLE GP12; knee, pedal, FSR, limit ADC0-3; ISENSE ADC4 (GP44); VA, VB ADC5, ADC6; VBUS_S ADC7 (GP47)." (at 20.32 268.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 765cf2fa-844b-4e84-9051-de78b3f73a6e))
(text "3. A2 truth table: PWM high drives (DIR sets the way); PWM low brakes (both outputs low). Its PWM input is pulled low on the board, so a" (at 20.32 270.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8c1e3052-92ac-4c9a-a0ca-6f9a80585a8b))
(text "   resetting MCU leaves the motor braked. CS is about 40 mV/A, valid only while driving: sample it mid on-time. No capacitor on CS." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9600eb50-4ef4-4d28-bab2-a566d398968b))
(text "4. R4 lowers A2's current limit from its default ~30 A (100k gives ~16 A); aim for 8-10 A and set it on the bench with the motor stalled." (at 20.32 275.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e6fc8bf1-5d16-432c-80e6-f5252194b375))
(text "5. Slow down by braking (PWM low), which spends the energy in the motor's own resistance. Never reverse at speed: that pumps the bus up." (at 20.32 277.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 17b9d739-58be-4648-a498-d3cb1d1551ea))
(text "   Watch VBUS_S; if it rises past ~28 V, stop driving and fire the brake chopper (Q1, R9), if fitted. D1 only catches short spikes." (at 20.32 280.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 76fc3baa-75b6-4d4e-96a2-64f18f8b5b67))
(text "6. VA, VB read each motor terminal (/11): their difference is the motor's voltage; with A2 asleep (SLP low) it is the back-EMF, the speed." (at 20.32 282.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 095355c4-bc21-4fa6-9780-b12dfd7803ec))
(text "7. C19 and two 47n caps from each terminal to the motor case go at the motor; twist the motor leads. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, as before." (at 20.32 285.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 003206d6-15f4-408c-88c6-b294f4cd7a4c))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
